wo real regressions that only surfaced in the integrated environment: the test-all compose wrapper now expands per-suite project names correctly, and the Spring Security custom filters are ordered relative to filters with known framework ordering so the backend starts cleanly in containerized tests.\n\nAlso align the CloudApp integration expectation with the current authorization contract for cross-user cart access, which now returns 403 rather than 404.\n\nValidation rerun after the fixes: frontend:test, test-backend, test-ai-monitor-behavior, test-nginx-gateway, test-api-contracts, and test-e2e (169 passed, 9 skipped, 1 flaky, exit code 0).","tree":{"sha":"751f5d9e94c4c72c5cc53f8a4b36de76a06894e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/751f5d9e94c4c72c5cc53f8a4b36de76a06894e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/c984cd03a80f6ee262f20def2fea7bc7b260a63e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"ht