"date":"2026-04-11T05:09:46Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"refactor(ai-control-plane): move core router dependencies onto app state\n\nIntroduce a shared AIControlPlaneState container on FastAPI app.state and use it to provide orchestrator, memory, context-store, tool-manager, and audit-service dependencies to the main orchestration, tools, and system routers.\n\nThis removes the setter-based module globals from those routers and keeps startup wiring inside the FastAPI lifespan where the control plane is actually created. The approvals router still uses its existing HITL-specific wiring for now so the lifecycle refactor stays separated from approval-flow behavior changes.\n\nValidated with ''python3 -m py_compile ai-orchestration/ai-orchestration-layer/src/core/app_state.py ai-orchestration/ai-orchestration-layer/src/main.py ai-orchestration/ai-orchestration-layer/src/routers/orchestration_router.py ai-orchestration/ai-orchestration-layer/src/routers/tools_router.py ai-orchestration/ai-orchestration-layer/src/routers/system_router.py''.","tree":{"sha":"583eabfdf38df1072b7b79a02c100ba061a863de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/583eabfdf38df1072b7b79a02c100ba061a863de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/b79495e9c3d59fdc098d1496b3c868f8790c19dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/b79495e9c3d59fdc098d1496b3c868f8790c19dd","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKGI3OTQ5NWU5YzNkNTlmZGMwOThkMTQ5NmIzYzg2OGY4NzkwYzE5ZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/2bb17e697258680f9d5bf4d9bf8329892361aada","sha":"2bb17e697258680f9d5bf4d9bf8329892361aada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/2bb17e697258680f9d5bf4d9bf8329892361aada"}],"sha":"b79495e9c3d59fdc098d1496b3c868f8790c19dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/b79495e9c3d59fdc098d1496b3c868f8790c19dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/2bb17e697258680f9d5bf4d9bf8329892361aada/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T05:06:17Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T05:06:17Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"refactor(frontend-shell): migrate CloudApp hooks to shared clients\n\nAdopt the shared frontend platform clients across the CloudApp shell hooks by introducing a local cloudappClient helper backed by @portfolio/api-clients and @portfolio/auth instead of keeping raw axios/fetch calls in each hook.\n\nLogin, logout, register, files, cart, notes, items, room lookup, and chat socket initialization now route through the shared browser/session clients. The chat HTTP helper also carries typed response envelopes so the existing room and chat pages keep their current behavior while gaining compile-time safety.\n\nValidated with ''npm run typecheck --workspace frontend/cloudapp-shell''.","tree":{"sha":"d9440066e7261976f446cf9e88704a7844bf6106","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/d9440066e7261976f446cf9e88704a7844bf6106"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/2bb17e697258680f9d5bf4d9bf8329892361aada","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/2bb17e697258680f9d5bf4d9bf8329892361aada","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKDJiYjE3ZTY5NzI1ODY4MGY5ZDViZjRkOWJmODMyOTg5MjM2MWFhZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/09a4627909b6aade352ddb252fc7028348b7a95a","sha":"09a4627909b6aade352ddb252fc7028348b7a95a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/09a4627909b6aade352ddb252fc7028348b7a95a"}],"sha":"2bb17e697258680f9d5bf4d9bf8329892361aada","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/2bb17e697258680f9d5bf4d9bf8329892361aada"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/09a4627909b6aade352ddb252fc7028348b7a95a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T05:00:44Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T05:00:44Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"feat(frontend-platform): add shared CloudApp browser and session clients\n\nExtend the shared frontend platform packages with a browser-oriented CloudApp client that supports JSON, text, blob, and form-style requests while reusing the existing base URL and generated contract client factories.\n\nThe core client factories now live in a dedicated api-clients core module, the package barrel exports both core and browser helpers, and @portfolio/auth now exposes createCloudAppSessionClient for CSRF-aware browser requests. Auth state refresh also uses a shared expected-error helper so the same error semantics can be reused by the shell.\n\nValidated with ''npm run typecheck --workspace frontend/cloudapp-shell''.","tree":{"sha":"b213cee2faf86e7efc26543c80a72a8c169c6c55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/b213cee2faf86e7efc26543c80a72a8c169c6c55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/09a4627909b6aade352ddb252fc7028348b7a95a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/09a4627909b6aade352ddb252fc7028348b7a95a","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKDA5YTQ2Mjc5MDliNmFhZGUzNTJkZGIyNTJmYzcwMjgzNDhiN2E5NWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/1a7967aac1e3ef2f2a8c7f97b1a87fe974bd8459","sha":"1a7967aac1e3ef2f2a8c7f97b1a87fe974bd8459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/1a7967aac1e3ef2f2a8c7f97b1a87fe974bd8459"}],"sha":"09a4627909b6aade352ddb252fc7028348b7a95a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/09a4627909b6aade352ddb252fc7028348b7a95a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/1a7967aac1e3ef2f2a8c7f97b1a87fe974bd8459/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:58:03Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:58:03Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"refactor(cloudapp-collaboration): isolate room and messaging services\n\nMove the room and message abstractions into a dedicated collaboration package so websocket, room-directory, and persisted message behavior live behind one internal module boundary.\n\nMessageController and RoomController now depend on collaboration-scoped services, and RoomDirectoryService owns the user-room lookup/assembly flow that previously lived inside RoomController. MessageService was also cleaned up to use constructor injection and return empty room lists instead of sentinel error strings.\n\nValidated with ''mvn -q -pl backend/cloudapp -am -DskipTests compile''.","tree":{"sha":"cdfe8585cff0e1983e9337fa469d3a116a9dce1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/cdfe8585cff0e1983e9337fa469d3a116a9dce1c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/1a7967aac1e3ef2f2a8c7f97b1a87fe974bd8459","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/1a7967aac1e3ef2f2a8c7f97b1a87fe974bd8459","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKDFhNzk2N2FhYzFlM2VmMmYyYThjN2Y5N2IxYTg3ZmU5NzRiZDg0NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/f2de11f44411efebc41e115db2922fc6778aa10d","sha":"f2de11f44411efebc41e115db2922fc6778aa10d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/f2de11f44411efebc41e115db2922fc6778aa10d"}],"sha":"1a7967aac1e3ef2f2a8c7f97b1a87fe974bd8459","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/1a7967aac1e3ef2f2a8c7f97b1a87fe974bd8459"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/f2de11f44411efebc41e115db2922fc6778aa10d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:56:04Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:56:04Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"refactor(cloudapp-commerce): carve out a dedicated commerce module\n\nMove the existing item and order service abstractions into a new commerce package and add a dedicated CartService so cart mutations no longer execute repository logic directly inside CartController.\n\nItemController and OrderController now depend on commerce-scoped interfaces, while CartController delegates add, remove, fetch, and clear flows to CartService through CartResult. This creates one internal package for item, cart, and order behavior instead of spreading commerce concerns across generic service folders and controllers.\n\nValidated with ''mvn -q -pl backend/cloudapp -am -DskipTests compile''.","tree":{"sha":"5d2777d820b10eb71f32ab087347c7d9fdcbe5bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/5d2777d820b10eb71f32ab087347c7d9fdcbe5bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/f2de11f44411efebc41e115db2922fc6778aa10d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/f2de11f44411efebc41e115db2922fc6778aa10d","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKGYyZGUxMWY0NDQxMWVmZWJjNDFlMTE1ZGIyOTIyZmM2Nzc4YWExMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/b6db87d68281b8f49c9e614a6af125154f5ca2e7","sha":"b6db87d68281b8f49c9e614a6af125154f5ca2e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/b6db87d68281b8f49c9e614a6af125154f5ca2e7"}],"sha":"f2de11f44411efebc41e115db2922fc6778aa10d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/f2de11f44411efebc41e115db2922fc6778aa10d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/b6db87d68281b8f49c9e614a6af125154f5ca2e7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:53:37Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:53:37Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"refactor(cloudapp-content): introduce content services for notes and files\n\nCreate a dedicated content module package for CloudApp note and file flows so controllers no longer reach straight into NoteRepository, FileRepository, or UserRepository for their main operations.\n\nNoteController now delegates note lookups, creation, updates, and deletion to NoteContentService. FileController now delegates file discovery, storage validation, and deletion to FileContentService, with FileUploadResult carrying the upload outcome back to the HTTP layer.\n\nThis keeps the existing HTTP contract stable while turning notes and files into a real internal content boundary that can be evolved independently. Validated with ''mvn -q -pl backend/cloudapp -am -DskipTests compile''.","tree":{"sha":"fb885c4e1f2f95bc1e12535469367911fe19756c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/fb885c4e1f2f95bc1e12535469367911fe19756c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/b6db87d68281b8f49c9e614a6af125154f5ca2e7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/b6db87d68281b8f49c9e614a6af125154f5ca2e7","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKGI2ZGI4N2Q2ODI4MWI4ZjQ5YzllNjE0YTZhZjEyNTE1NGY1Y2EyZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/300ec2ad8ef37cf86966e7566776f5611504d8d4","sha":"300ec2ad8ef37cf86966e7566776f5611504d8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/300ec2ad8ef37cf86966e7566776f5611504d8d4"}],"sha":"b6db87d68281b8f49c9e614a6af125154f5ca2e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/b6db87d68281b8f49c9e614a6af125154f5ca2e7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/300ec2ad8ef37cf86966e7566776f5611504d8d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:51:28Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:51:28Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"refactor(cloudapp): centralize caller identity and ownership checks\n\nAdd a shared CloudappAccessPolicy that resolves authenticated usernames from Spring Security, bearer headers, or the auth cookie and uses the validated internal-service identity when service-to-service requests are allowed.\n\nUser, note, file, cart, order, and room controllers now delegate access decisions to that shared policy instead of each carrying their own principal parsing and ownership checks. This removes duplicated controller logic, keeps the authorization rules consistent, and creates a single seam for later module extraction.\n\nValidated with ''mvn -q -pl backend/cloudapp -am -DskipTests compile''.","tree":{"sha":"fae4fd78619322b0bbdae8462aa6cc990fcec5e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/fae4fd78619322b0bbdae8462aa6cc990fcec5e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/300ec2ad8ef37cf86966e7566776f5611504d8d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/300ec2ad8ef37cf86966e7566776f5611504d8d4","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKDMwMGVjMmFkOGVmMzdjZjg2OTY2ZTc1NjY3NzZmNTYxMTUwNGQ4ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/18d22a3e693b798ae2c48546f65c30da80ce15fb","sha":"18d22a3e693b798ae2c48546f65c30da80ce15fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/18d22a3e693b798ae2c48546f65c30da80ce15fb"}],"sha":"300ec2ad8ef37cf86966e7566776f5611504d8d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/300ec2ad8ef37cf86966e7566776f5611504d8d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/18d22a3e693b798ae2c48546f65c30da80ce15fb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:48:19Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-11T04:48:19Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"feat(security): replace shared internal bypass with scoped service identities\n\nIntroduce explicit internal service credentials across the gateway, CloudApp, and the AI orchestration layer instead of relying on the old shared X-Internal-Auth bypass token.\n\nCloudApp now resolves named internal service identities, authenticates them through a dedicated pre-auth filter, and skips CSRF only for validated service-to-service traffic. The blanket permitAll internal filter chain has been removed so internal callers are authenticated rather than silently bypassing the main security stack.\n\nThe gateway and AI orchestration layer now forward X-Internal-Service-Name and X-Internal-Service-Token headers with dedicated tokens for gateway-admin-proxy and ai-orchestration. Compose files, environment templates, smoke tooling, and tests were updated to reflect the new contract and keep operational setup aligned with the code.","tree":{"sha":"2914b869bf7b47e9d1f5178316a3765e7a008964","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/2914b869bf7b47e9d1f5178316a3765e7a008964"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/18d22a3e693b798ae2c48546f65c30da80ce15fb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_ev