w/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/818b5e998fe79943c729df8036814878b9f3480d","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKDgxOGI1ZTk5OGZlNzk5NDNjNzI5ZGY4MDM2ODE0ODc4YjlmMzQ4MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/fd23be82bcd56f9dac3d15783ae67e679058798c","sha":"fd23be82bcd56f9dac3d15783ae67e679058798c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/fd23be82bcd56f9dac3d15783ae67e679058798c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/cab1bcdf470abac99e8011f5f0980674083bd871","sha":"cab1bcdf470abac99e8011f5f0980674083bd871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/cab1bcdf470abac99e8011f5f0980674083bd871"}],"sha":"818b5e998fe79943c729df8036814878b9f3480d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/818b5e998fe79943c729df8036814878b9f3480d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/cab1bcdf470abac99e8011f5f0980674083bd871/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T17:05:19Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T18:24:30Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"feat(showcase): add portfolio mode with deterministic demo path\n\nIntroduce a true portfolio-first runtime for the repo and make the default\nshowcase story smaller, more repeatable, and easier to demo.\n\nStartup and runtime changes:\n- add `scripts/showcase-up.sh` as the supported one-command entrypoint\n- make `portfolio` the default showcase mode and keep `hero` as a compatible alias\n- update reset/preflight scripts to default to portfolio mode and sync mode flags in `.env`\n- split optional services and infra behind compose profiles so the default stack only exposes\n  shell + gateway + cloudapp + openmaps (+ vehicles backend)\n- pass explicit remote enable flags and internal status URLs into the shell runtime\n- rebuild the app stack from the showcase startup flow so mode switches do not get stuck behind\n  stale Next.js build-time env values\n\nPortfolio demo determinism:\n- extend CloudApp demo seeding with opt-in seeded portfolio content\n- seed a repeatable walkthrough baseline: demo notes, a downloadable file, a chat room, and\n  starter chat messages\n- add portfolio vehicle seeding for the OpenMaps showcase path\n- wire new seed flags through compose and reset flow\n\nShell curation and remote gating:\n- replace duplicated shell route/card definitions with a shared module registry\n- add route metadata for dashboard cards, remote ownership, and visibility logic\n- drive nav and homepage visibility from remote enablement plus admin access\n- add runtime remote availability checks through a same-origin status API\n- hide Jira, ChatLLM, MLOps, and PetStore icons when disabled or when their remotes are not reachable\n- add guarded remote route wrappers so direct visits show a clear unavailable/opt-in state instead of\n  failing with a broken remote load\n- keep OpenMaps visible during initial availability checks to preserve the default portfolio path\n\nDocs and repo story cleanup:\n- align README, TESTING, shell README, CloudApp README, and platform docs around portfolio mode\n- keep the main README structure intact while changing the supported default story to:\n  shell + gateway + cloudapp + openmaps first, AI/operator as a second act\n- move Jira, ChatLLM, MLOps, PetStore, Umami, and mobile packaging to extended/optional framing\n\nVerification:\n- add route visibility tests for admin gating and remote availability suppression\n- verify shell scripts with `bash -n`\n- verify shell changes with frontend typecheck and targeted Jest coverage\n- verify CloudApp and Vehicles backend compilation with Maven","tree":{"sha":"5c02014b0cf811482db3694f04c610ced55b8965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/5c02014b0cf811482db3694f04c610ced55b8965"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/cab1bcdf470abac99e8011f5f0980674083bd871","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/cab1bcdf470abac99e8011f5f0980674083bd871","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKGNhYjFiY2RmNDcwYWJhYzk5ZTgwMTFmNWYwOTgwNjc0MDgzYmQ4NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/ff9b9d1755a08a12439e7c062acc754e0c0d7d96","sha":"ff9b9d1755a08a12439e7c062acc754e0c0d7d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/ff9b9d1755a08a12439e7c062acc754e0c0d7d96"}],"sha":"cab1bcdf470abac99e8011f5f0980674083bd871","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/cab1bcdf470abac99e8011f5f0980674083bd871"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/ff9b9d1755a08a12439e7c062acc754e0c0d7d96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-30T07:45:34Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-30T07:45:34Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"test: enforce UI bundle budgets for showcase surfaces\n\nAdd build-time UI budget enforcement for the browser entry surfaces that matter most to the flagship story. The CloudApp shell now has a dedicated core-showcase budget gate, and the AI monitor budget is enforced inside its existing build validation flow with a monitor-specific budget script.\n\nWire the new checks through docker-compose and CI, update the test/docs surfaces so the budget layer is visible in the showcase smoke-path model, and extend the release and stewardship guidance so hero browser-entry changes are expected to keep budget checks green alongside static and behavioral gates.\n\nThe shell budget currently verifies initial shared JS gzip size against a 450KB cap, and the AI monitor budget verifies shipped JS gzip size against a 160KB cap.","tree":{"sha":"ba5901e7fba64e1950f56c268c75444f7e930249","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/ba5901e7fba64e1950f56c268c75444f7e930249"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/ff9b9d1755a08a12439e7c062acc754e0c0d7d96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cj