dency and build configuration from vehicles-api (cxf-spring-boot-starter-jaxws, jaxws-rt, the Spring Cloud BOM import, and the cxf-codegen plugin)\n- deleted the unused ApiError DTO and cleaned the ErrorController comment to reflect the current ProblemDetail approach\n- simplified CarService and CarController by removing starter-course TODO scaffolding and redundant code paths while preserving existing behavior\n- cleaned the CarController test comments to match the now-implemented coverage\n- added runtime-and-data-policy.md with approved defaults, review rules, and migration guidance for each current non-default store\n- linked the new policy from the platform docs index and deployable inventory\n\nVerification:\n- mvn -Dtest=VehiclesApiApplicationTests,CarControllerTest,CarServiceTest test\n- attempted mvn test, but VehiclesApiIntegrationTest could not start embedded Tomcat in the sandbox because port binding is not permitted (SocketException: Operation not permitted)","tree":{"sha":"12501c9719cbc4e46b755f1ecb85e1b60b27971c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/12501c9719cbc4e46b755f1ecb85e1b60b27971c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/b50d7b68926932c68b4616d38f1bc7ddb465c229","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/b50d7b68926932c68b4616d38f1bc7ddb465c229","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKGI1MGQ3YjY4OTI2OTMyYzY4YjQ2MTZkMzhmMWJjN2RkYjQ2NWMyMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/d3ac494a60c07726291e7b9dc9bcae3247e245c4","sha":"d3ac494a60c07726291e7b9dc9bcae3247e245c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/d3ac494a60c07726291e7b9dc9bcae3247e245c4"}],"sha":"b50d7b68926932c68b4616d38f1bc7ddb465c229","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/b50d7b68926932c68b4616d38f1bc7ddb465c229"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/d3ac494a60c07726291e7b9dc9bcae3247e245c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T15:18:48Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T15:18:48Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"BE-02/BE-04: standardize CloudApp backend service contracts\n\nAdopt a first shared Spring backend pattern in CloudApp by moving item and order validation/not-found handling into the service layer and mapping those failures through RFC 7807 ProblemDetail responses.\n\nWhat changed:\n- added explicit RequestValidationException and ResourceNotFoundException types for service-owned failure cases\n- extended GlobalExceptionHandler to map validation and not-found exceptions, plus MethodArgumentNotValidException, to consistent ProblemDetail responses\n- changed ItemService and OrderService to validate inputs, log notable mutation and anomaly paths, and return domain objects instead of controller-facing Optional/boolean wrappers\n- simplified ItemController and OrderController so they translate HTTP concerns only and rely on the shared exception layer for 400/404 responses\n- added backend-service-standards.md and backend-service-taxonomy.md and linked them from the platform governance index\n- updated focused controller/service tests and added an integration assertion for invalid item payload handling\n\nVerification:\n- mvn -Dtest=ItemControllerTest,OrderControllerTest,ItemServiceTest,OrderServiceTest test\n- attempted mvn -Dtest=CloudAppIntegrationTest,ItemControllerTest,OrderControllerTest,ItemServiceTest,OrderServiceTest test, but CloudAppIntegrationTest could not open the PostgreSQL test connection in the sandbox (SocketException: Operation not permitted)","tree":{"sha":"8803bbc12c2d125f14f13a60c58499dc566b0638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/8803bbc12c2d125f14f13a60c58499dc566b0638"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/d3ac494a60c07726291e7b9dc9bcae3247e245c4"