m/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/179725f4ab936964339e8e81c92140d1e90a94a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T14:48:32Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T14:48:32Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"test(ai-monitor): add component behavior coverage on the workspace branch\n\nAIM-03\n\nCherry-pick the monitor behavior coverage onto the workspace branch and resolve the conflicts against the PR3-PR6 work already present here.\n\nThis branch already had:\n- docs drift guardrails in CI\n- a routed Playwright monitor behavior gate\n- shared @portfolio/* workspace packages\n- a consolidated orchestration client\n\nInstead of replacing those pieces, this commit makes PR7 additive and branch-compatible by:\n- adding Vitest/jsdom component tests for CloudApp auth hydration, UnifiedDashboard status rendering, and ApprovalInterface approve-and-resume behavior\n- updating the new tests to target the consolidated orchestration client and the shared @portfolio/auth package introduced on this branch\n- adding an ai-monitor-component-tests CI job and test-ai-monitor-component compose service while preserving the existing routed Playwright ai-monitor-behavior-tests job\n- keeping docs drift coverage and updating test docs and TESTING.md to describe both the component and browser monitor gates\n- making the monitor Vite config prefer the workspace React install so the new tests do not trip duplicate-React hook failures\n- updating the dockerized monitor lint/component services to copy a clean repo snapshot, install the local @portfolio/* packages by path, and apply the Rollup native fallback used by the monitor container so Linux ARM test runs stay stable\n- updating the root workspace lockfile to capture the Testing Library and jsdom additions needed for the new operator-app suite\n\nVerification:\n- npm run typecheck --workspace ai-orchestration/ai-orchestration-monitor\n- npm run test --workspace ai-orchestration/ai-orchestration-monitor -- --reporter=dot\n- npm run build --workspace ai-orchestration/ai-orchestration-monitor\n- python3 scripts/check_docs_drift.py\n- docker compose -f docker-compose.test.yml config\n- docker compose -f docker-compose.test.yml up --build --abort-on-container-exit test-ai-monitor-component\n- docker compose -f docker-compose.test.yml up --build --abort-on-container-exit test-ai-monitor-lint","tree":{"sha":"baf07ac9b2d9fd88982da447ac16ee8f9df5490e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/baf07ac9b2d9fd88982da447ac16ee8f9df5490e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/179725f4ab936964339e8e81c92140d1e90a94a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","org