"date":"2026-03-17T09:55:10Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"CLEAN-01: remove the tracked CarService backup artifact\n\nDelete the checked-in  file from . Backup files in the main source tree create ambiguity during reviews, widen the search surface for maintainers, and make it less clear which implementation is authoritative.\n\nThis change is intentionally narrow: it removes the stale artifact without altering the active  implementation or any runtime behavior.","tree":{"sha":"a83b40e27773a1b5941c7c6c9fa4f8dd46370d4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/a83b40e27773a1b5941c7c6c9fa4f8dd46370d4c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/54de20e7302c383b7303b92ce37312f5c69ed422","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/54de20e7302c383b7303b92ce37312f5c69ed422","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKDU0ZGUyMGU3MzAyYzM4M2I3MzAzYjkyY2UzNzMxMmY1YzY5ZWQ0MjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/978d22cfa32b2e482886fa09de2310c2d7a98ab6","sha":"978d22cfa32b2e482886fa09de2310c2d7a98ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/978d22cfa32b2e482886fa09de2310c2d7a98ab6"}],"sha":"54de20e7302c383b7303b92ce37312f5c69ed422","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/54de20e7302c383b7303b92ce37312f5c69ed422"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/978d22cfa32b2e482886fa09de2310c2d7a98ab6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T07:44:29Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T09:55:10Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"SEC-03: remove stale AI Studio and Gemini monitor references\n\nReplace the generated AI Studio README with repo-native operator-app documentation that describes the monitor as a local Vite frontend for the orchestration platform rather than a hosted Gemini app.\n\nThe Vite configuration also drops the unused Gemini-related  shims so the build only reflects the runtime inputs that the monitor actually uses: the gateway and orchestration  URLs plus request timeout settings.\n\nThis keeps the committed monitor surface aligned with the real platform architecture and avoids implying that a Gemini API key or AI Studio deployment is part of the supported runtime path.","tree":{"sha":"3ab322d870e2b0e494a4ef2c7b675dfbfb0deec4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/3ab322d870e2b0e494a4ef2c7b675dfbfb0deec4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/978d22cfa32b2e482886fa09de2310c2d7a98ab6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/978d22cfa32b2e482886fa09de2310c2d7a98ab6","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKDk3OGQyMmNmYTMyYjJlNDgyODg2ZmEwOWRlMjMxMGMyZDdhOThhYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/b6f21f70e95a5d60863b8801664e98af4d26ef0e","sha":"b6f21f70e95a5d60863b8801664e98af4d26ef0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/b6f21f70e95a5d60863b8801664e98af4d26ef0e"}],"sha":"978d22cfa32b2e482886fa09de2310c2d7a98ab6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/978d22cfa32b2e482886fa09de2310c2d7a98ab6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/b6f21f70e95a5d60863b8801664e98af4d26ef0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T07:43:24Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T09:55:03Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"SEC-01: make CloudApp demo-user seeding explicitly opt in\n\nStop treating seeded demo credentials as a normal local default. The app compose file now reads the demo-user seed controls from the environment and defaults the feature to disabled instead of always creating known users on startup.\n\nThe CloudApp DemoUserSeeder no longer carries fallback usernames and passwords in code. When demo seeding is enabled without explicit credentials, it logs that the seed was skipped rather than silently falling back to hardcoded values.\n\nThe environment example and README are updated to document the opt-in flow so local testing remains possible, but the repository no longer advertises pre-seeded credentials as the baseline behavior.","tree":{"sha":"9aa4dbe6dbbac3f3a2f217d73583ac2837dac3a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/9aa4dbe6dbbac3f3a2f217d73583ac2837dac3a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/b6f21f70e95a5d60863b8801664e98af4d26ef0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/b6f21f70e95a5d60863b8801664e98af4d26ef0e","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKGI2ZjIxZjcwZTk1YTVkNjA4NjNiODgwMTY2NGU5OGFmNGQyNmVmMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/f3ad74d9b292c508aabcf6c6c2f486b9fd3716ce","sha":"f3ad74d9b292c508aabcf6c6c2f486b9fd3716ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/f3ad74d9b292c508aabcf6c6c2f486b9fd3716ce"}],"sha":"b6f21f70e95a5d60863b8801664e98af4d26ef0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/b6f21f70e95a5d60863b8801664e98af4d26ef0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/f3ad74d9b292c508aabcf6c6c2f486b9fd3716ce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T07:42:16Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T09:54:49Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"CI-01: enforce AI monitor typecheck in the test stack\n\nAdd the AI monitor typecheck step to the docker-based test service so the monitor is held to the same static quality bar as the other browser-facing surfaces.\n\nThe commit also fixes the existing monitor TypeScript drift that would have made the new gate fail immediately. The monitor now has Vite env typings, refreshed shared frontend type definitions for approvals, experiments, RAG stats, and service data, plus a few compatibility aliases in the orchestration client for older hook call patterns that still exist in the codebase.\n\nAs part of making the new gate actionable, the stale duplicate monitor hooks are excluded from typecheck until they are removed in the follow-up cleanup ticket, and the test documentation is updated to reflect that the monitor static checks now include typecheck, lint, and build validation.","tree":{"sha":"1208cbdfd16253ea5485ddf464e853543599c976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/1208cbdfd16253ea5485ddf464e853543599c976"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/f3ad74d9b292c508aabcf6c6c2f486b9fd3716ce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/f3ad74d9b292c508aabcf6c6c2f486b9fd3716ce","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKGYzYWQ3NGQ5YjI5MmM1MDhhYWJjZjZjNmMyZjQ4NmI5ZmQzNzE2Y2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/029d90213218658dbf69a639af766ef879fbb0a0","sha":"029d90213218658dbf69a639af766ef879fbb0a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/029d90213218658dbf69a639af766ef879fbb0a0"}],"sha":"f3ad74d9b292c508aabcf6c6c2f486b9fd3716ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/f3ad74d9b292c508aabcf6c6c2f486b9fd3716ce"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/029d90213218658dbf69a639af766ef879fbb0a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-17T07:32:50Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-17T09:54:49Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"DOC-02: rewrite test documentation for the current CI stack\n\nReplace the outdated test README with a current guide centered on docker-compose.test.yml and the actual CI matrix.\n\nThe new document:\n- documents the active test services instead of historical paths\n- replaces Cypress references with the current Playwright-based E2E flow\n- explains the backend, gateway, AI, contract, frontend, and browser layers\n- points readers to the checked-in test source locations that are actually used\n- captures the full-matrix runner and individual suite commands in one place\n\nThis keeps the repo documentation aligned with the test stack that is currently exercised in local development and GitHub Actions.","tree":{"sha":"d10cb52381b0ee07416df8e2eb04449c163c0f10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/d10cb52381b0ee07416df8e2eb04449c163c0f10"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/029d90213218658dbf69a639af766ef879fbb0a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54838312?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos","id":54838312,"login":"cjakabos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0ODM4MzEy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commit/029d90213218658dbf69a639af766ef879fbb0a0","node_id":"C_kwDOGVz28doAKDAyOWQ5MDIxMzIxODY1