\n- add Capacitor/mobile test assets\n  - frontend/cloudapp-shell/capacitor.config.ts\n  - frontend/cloudapp-shell/scripts/check-bundle-budget.mjs\n  - frontend/cloudapp-shell/src/mobile/*.smoke.test.ts\n  - tests/e2e/mobile/maestro/android-smoke.yaml\n  - generated Android/iOS wrapper projects under frontend/cloudapp-shell/{android,ios}\n- wire project tooling for mobile\n  - update frontend/cloudapp-shell/package.json + package-lock.json with Capacitor deps/scripts\n  - include mobile smoke tests in jest config\n  - add mobile Makefile targets\n  - add docker-compose.test.yml web-test service for Docker-first mobile build/sync\n  - update tsconfig excludes for generated mobile/build dirs\n- fix Android local runtime networking\n  - default mobile API base to localhost:8080/cloudapp (adb reverse 8080 -> host 80)\n  - add hosted bundle API-base verification/warning in Android script\n  - make Docker script steps fail fast (`set -e`)\n  - expose nginx on 8080 and bake Android-safe API envs in docker-compose-app shell build args\n- fix iOS local packaging without mandatory local CocoaPods\n  - switch to `npx cap copy ios` + explicit pod install step\n  - add `IOS_POD_MODE` auto/local/docker/skip with Docker CocoaPods fallback\n  - mirror same pod fallback in iOS smoke script\n- improve login reliability on iOS keyboard/input behavior\n  - disable autocorrect/autocapitalize on auth fields\n  - normalize usernames to trimmed lowercase in UI/login/register payloads\n- document full mobile workflow and update ignore rules for generated mobile artifacts","tree":{"sha":"247168ad8f4f64dae923472db73ac32128939f00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/247168ad8f4f64dae923472db73ac32128939f00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/commits/783edb4421e28b1219c3ef699568349f7d626513","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://ava