//api.github.com/users/cjakabos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cjakabos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/commits/10d6b7def68dfb805eb54d1a337fa895d00a3e39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-28T17:24:19Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-28T19:36:19Z","email":"csaba.jakabos@gmail.com","name":"cjakabos"},"message":"Add Flyway schema governance and harden JPA data integrity\n\n- add Flyway to CloudApp and Petstore and move main profiles to ddl-auto=validate\n- keep test profiles on create-drop with Flyway disabled for ephemeral integration databases\n- replace CloudApp data.sql seeding with Flyway migrations and idempotent item seed data\n- remove destructive CascadeType.ALL usage from UserOrder item relationships\n- make CloudApp cart/order join tables explicit and indexed\n- add selective table indexes for common lookup and join paths in CloudApp and Petstore\n- add ID-based equals/hashCode implementations to the JPA entities touched by persistence-sensitive flows\n- fix the Note setId naming bug and align entity column/table mappings with the migration schema\n- remove unsafe Petstore many-to-many cascade settings and make join/collection tables explicit\n\nAdd least-privilege workflow permissions and optional dependency audits\n\n- add top-level GitHub Actions permissions with contents: read\n- add a non-blocking dependency scan job to ci-tests.yml\n- run npm audit for cloudapp-shell and ai-orchestration-monitor production dependencies\n- run pip-audit for ml-pipeline and ai-orchestration-layer requirements\n- upload JSON audit reports as workflow artifacts\n- include dependency scan results in the CI summary without failing PRs on findings","tree":{"sha":"9a0a0ad4c53131fa68a8cd7b073f0ebc19794180","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cjakabos/portfolio-web/git/trees/9a0a0ad4c53131fa68a8cd7b073f0