r/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commits/0b3a73c33e53aa262db022f8d7b825a50b9ba781/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:18:35Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T13:18:35Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"Dev-Harness auf das CORS-Bundle-Template angleichen\n\nDer Dev-Harness folgt jetzt dem Referenz-Layout von cors/pimcore-seo und\ncors/pimcore-sso, damit der Datei-Sync aus shared-workflows-private die\nHarness-Dateien übernehmen kann (byte-identisch zu pimcore-seo: static.yaml,\nlicense.yaml, routes*, packages/{dev,prod,staging,test}, doctrine_mapping_types,\npimcore_studio_backend, preload.php, docker-compose.yaml, bin/console,\npublic/index.php, security.yaml, bundles.php, phpstan.neon, psalm.xml).\n\n- docker-compose.yaml: handgeschriebener mysql/nginx/traefik-Stack durch das\n  OCI-Include ghcr.io/cors-gmbh/dev-compose:pimcore2026.1 ersetzt; .docker/\n  (nginx.conf, php.ini, xdebug.ini, supervisord) entfällt damit.\n- .env: Docker-Block (DOCKER_PROJECT_NAME=cors-pimcore-webcare, PHP 8.4),\n  DATABASE_URL auf den dev-compose-Dienst db, OpenSearch- und Mercure-Block\n  (Host cors-pimcore-webcare.dev.localhost), Instanz-Identifier pimcore-webcare.\n- config/config.yaml: local/*.yaml-Import und env-Defaults wie im Template.\n- Neu: config/packages/staging, routes/{prod,staging}, doctrine_mapping_types,\n  pimcore_studio_backend, dev/InstallProfile/StudioInstallProfile.php,\n  phpstan.neon, .gitattributes (Bundle-Root ist src/, alles andere export-ignore).\n- ecs.php / phpstan.neon / psalm.xml importieren die Konfiguration aus cors/dev.\n- composer.json: require-dev auf cors/dev ^2026.1, phpunit ^11, symfony/runtime\n  ^8.1, symfony/dotenv ^8.0 (dotenv aus require verschoben); direkte ECS-,\n  PHPStan- und Psalm-Pins entfernt; autoload-dev für dev/ und var/classes.\n- static.yaml: PHPStan aktiviert (phpstan.neon vorhanden).\n- README: Development-Abschnitt mit dem Harness-Setup.","tree":{"sha":"677685a8388159d993bce757185ce92efeeeae0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/git/trees/677685a8388159d993bce757185ce92efeeeae0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/git/commits/0b3a73c33e53aa262db022f8d7b825a50b9ba781","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com