uer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:23:56Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"Dev-Harness: SimpleBackendSearchBundle nicht mehr in config/bundles.php registrieren\n\nDer Kernel-Boot in den Static Tests scheiterte mit \"Class\nPimcore\\Bundle\\SimpleBackendSearchBundle\\PimcoreSimpleBackendSearchBundle not found\".\nDas Bundle gehörte zum klassischen ExtJS-Backend und existiert in Pimcore 2026 weder\nim Core (bundles/ enthält nur ApplicationLogger, Core, CustomReports,\nGenericExecutionEngine, Install, Seo, Uuid) noch als eigenes Paket auf Packagist,\nes gibt also nichts, was composer dafür nachziehen könnte. ApplicationLogger und\nGenericExecutionEngine liegen im Core, die restlichen Einträge kommen über\npimcore/studio-backend-bundle mit. Der Eintrag entfällt damit wie im Harness von\ncors/pimcore-sso.","tree":{"sha":"341c37de3d878856ced56513df72ba80afb6363c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/git/trees/341c37de3d878856ced56513df72ba80afb6363c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/git/commits/cf672c80d738ec574520f137c55a746d2d585d17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commit/cf672c80d738ec574520f137c55a746d2d585d17","node_id":"C_kwDOGWfXJdoAKGNmNjcyYzgwZDczOGVjNTc0NTIwZjEzN2M1NWE3NDZkMmQ1ODVkMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commit/f31dcfb963bd6baeb98095ea2cd583f0b09d5446","sha":"f31dcfb963bd6baeb98095ea2cd583f0b09d5446","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commits/f31dcfb963bd6baeb98095ea2cd583f0b09d5446"}],"sha":"cf672c80d738ec574520f137c55a746d2d585d17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commits/cf672c80d738ec574520f137c55a746d2d585d17"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commits/f31dcfb963bd6baeb98095ea2cd583f0b09d5446/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:04:11Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T12:04:11Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"CI: Static Tests mit registrierter Pimcore-Instanz über Repository-Secrets\n\nNeuer Workflow static.yaml über den Shared Workflow php-test\n(cors-gmbh/shared-workflows), PHP-Version aus DOCKER_PHP_VERSION=8.4 in\n.env (composer verlangt ~8.4.0 || ~8.5.0). PHPStan bleibt aus, weil das\nRepository keine phpstan.neon hat; Psalm und die Lints laufen.\n\nDie Registrierung kommt vollständig aus Env-Variablen: license.yaml liest\nSecret, Instanz-Identifier und Product-Key aus PIMCORE_ENCRYPTION_SECRET,\nPIMCORE_INSTANCE_IDENTIFIER und PIMCORE_PRODUCT_KEY; der hart codierte\nIdentifier 4qVzNp956AsKAvKzmGamvn entfällt. Der Identifier pimcore-webcare\nsteht in .env, Secret und Key kommen aus .env.local bzw. in CI aus den\nRepository-Secrets, die php-test über env_local nach .env.local schreibt.\n\nvar/classes/DataObject und config/local werden als leere Verzeichnisse\ngetrackt, weil die Pimcore-Extension bzw. der local/-Import in config.yaml\nin CI sonst scheitern. /public/var bleibt ignoriert.\n\nCloses #20","tree":{"sha":"0233395492c771d72250ea3eb14f2b8e44f58523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/git/trees/0233395492c771d72250ea3eb14f2b8e44f58523"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/git/commits/f31dcfb963bd6baeb98095ea2cd583f0b09d5446","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/