events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commits/c2cc200aa80b062e19ed4098cf2d429566926cf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T09:10:58Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T09:10:58Z","email":"dominik@pfaffenbauer.at","name":"Dominik Pfaffenbauer"},"message":"Pimcore Studio UI\n\nErgaenzt eine Studio-Oberflaeche fuer die WebCare-Site-Konfiguration. Die\nklassische ExtJS-Oberflaeche und die /admin-Routen bleiben unveraendert, beide\nlaufen parallel.\n\nBackend\n- Vier Single-Action-Controller unter /pimcore-studio/api/bundle/web-care/sites\n  (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE) mit Schema, MappedParameter, Hydrator, Service und\n  PreResponse-Event nach Studio-Backend-Konventionen\n- Die Liste bildet die Semantik des bisherigen ListController ab: jede Pimcore-Site\n  plus \"Home\" (siteId 0); Sites ohne Konfiguration kommen mit id null zurueck und\n  werden beim ersten Speichern angelegt\n- OpenAPI-Konfiguration (Prefix, Tags), Scan-Pfad in config.yml ergaenzt\n\nFrontend\n- Eigener Studio-Build im Bundle (rsbuild + Module Federation), ausgeliefert ueber\n  Studio/WebpackEntryPointProvider\n- Navigationseintrag unter System, Grid mit Anlegen/Bearbeiten/Loeschen ueber die\n  SDK-Komponenten, Uebersetzungen en/de\n\nPermission\n- Eigene Permission web_care_settings, angelegt vom Installer und beim Uninstall\n  wieder entfernt. Das bisherige Gate user.isAllowed(''plugins'') laeuft in\n  Pimcore 12 ins Leere: die Permission steht nicht in\n  users_permission_definitions, und Studios UserPermissionVoter unterstuetzt nur\n  Attribute, die er dort findet. Bestandsinstallationen brauchen die Zeile per\n  Migration und danach einen pimcore:cache:clear, weil der Voter die Liste im\n  Pimcore-Datencache haelt.\n\nTwig-Extension, Entity, Repository und die vier Legacy-Controller sind\nunveraendert.","tree":{"sha":"7e258038db4bc2c856b1a52fe3d69f2686289e46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/git/trees/7e258038db4bc2c856b1a52fe3d69f2686289e46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/git/commits/c2cc200aa80b062e19ed4098cf2d429566926cf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5981845?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dpfaffenbauer","id":5981845,"login":"dpfaffenbauer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5ODE4NDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dpfaffenbauer","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commit/c2cc200aa80b062e19ed4098cf2d429566926cf1","node_id":"C_kwDOGWfXJdoAKGMyY2MyMDBhYTgwYjA2MmUxOWVkNDA5OGNmMmQ0Mjk1NjY5MjZjZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cors-gmbh/pimcore-webcare/commit/f4d80d9202e18d5acc1be6cb8fe9c18d8e6792f5","sha":"f4d80d9202e18d5ac