sers/mistral-vibe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/commits/afc0ef65f0dc6d8c4cc7636c50b40d7d127f2d56/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:30:59Z","email":"vibe@mistral.ai","name":"Vibe Nuage Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T19:30:59Z","email":"vibe@mistral.ai","name":"Vibe Nuage Agent"},"message":"Enhanced example: Add advanced RuntimePluggableClassFactory capabilities\n\n- Integrated ResilientPluginClassFactory with circuit breaker and retry policies\n- Integrated CachedPluginClassFactory with instance caching and pooling\n- Added AsyncPluginClassFactory for non-blocking plugin loading\n- Added BulkOperationsController demonstrating parallel execution\n- Enhanced JobsController with multiple execution modes:\n  - Basic execution (standard factory)\n  - Async execution (async factory)\n  - Cached execution (cached factory)\n  - Resilient execution (resilient factory with circuit breaker)\n  - Type-safe execution (typed factory)\n- Added version range and module-based plugin queries\n- Added cache statistics and circuit breaker status endpoints\n- Added comprehensive configuration options for plugins\n- All changes are non-breaking and maintain backward compatibility\n\nThis makes PluginJobRunner an even better example of RuntimePluggableClassFactory capabilities.\n\nCloses #4\n\nCo-authored-by: larsbuch <larsbuch@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"37973721bed84c2a2ca795bea024a58d14c45ceb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/git/trees/37973721bed84c2a2ca795bea024a58d14c45ceb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/git/commits/afc0ef65f0dc6d8c4cc7636c50b40d7d127f2d56","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserco