istral-vibe","id":220374863,"login":"mistral-vibe","node_id":"U_kgDODSKnTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/commits/e34f3fbb768e20f94025b8e0ce55ed4c628d9df4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T18:23:05Z","email":"vibe@mistral.ai","name":"Vibe Nuage Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T18:23:05Z","email":"vibe@mistral.ai","name":"Vibe Nuage Agent"},"message":"Long-term optimizations: Add structured error codes, API versioning, OpenAPI docs, type-safe job executor, health checks, contract tests, load tests\n\n- Added structured error codes (JobErrorCode enum with categories)\n- Added API versioning with Microsoft.AspNetCore.Mvc.Versioning\n- Enhanced OpenAPI/Swagger documentation with versioning support\n- Created MergeSortArrayGeneric implementing IJobExecutor<TInput, TOutput>\n- Added PluginLoaderHealthCheck for monitoring plugin loader health\n- Added ContractTests.cs with API contract and plugin contract tests\n- Added LoadTests.cs with performance, concurrent, stress, and memory tests\n- Updated JobRunner.csproj with versioning packages\n- All changes are non-breaking and maintain backward compatibility\n\nCloses #4\n\nCo-authored-by: larsbuch <larsbuch@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"228eb17e03af0ccfe6c3e79c1f9205118a2414e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/git/trees/228eb17e03af0ccfe6c3e79c1f9205118a2414e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/git