lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mistral-vibe","id":220374863,"login":"mistral-vibe","node_id":"U_kgDODSKnTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/commits/fa838469a20f2c75561cbb4cfccbb6b8a1c516ca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T12:19:42Z","email":"vibe@mistral.ai","name":"Vibe Nuage Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T12:19:42Z","email":"vibe@mistral.ai","name":"Vibe Nuage Agent"},"message":"Medium-term: Type-Safe Job Execution and Plugin Validation\n\n- Added Type-Safe Job Execution:\n  - IJobExecutor<TInput, TOutput> generic interface\n  - JobExecutionResult<TOutput> for type-safe results\n  - MergeSortInput/MergeSortOutput DTOs\n  - MergeSortArrayGeneric implementing typed interface\n  - Uses async/await pattern with CancellationToken\n\n- Enhanced JobsController:\n  - Added PluginClassFactory<IJobExecutor> dependency\n  - Added JobExecutor validation via plugin factory\n  - Returns 400 BadRequest if executor not available\n\n- Updated Startup:\n  - Registered TypedPluginClassFactory for type-safe executors\n  - Added necessary using directives\n\nBenefits:\n- Strong typing for job input/output\n- Better error handling\n- Improved validation\n- More maintainable code\n\nFiles added/modified:\n- PluginInterface/IJobExecutorGeneric.cs (new)\n- 