eates plugin directory if not exists\n  - Setup PluginSecurityValidator with configurable settings\n  - Setup FilePluginLoader for IJobExecutor plugins\n  - Registered PluginClassFactory as singleton\n  - Plugins can now be loaded from Plugins/ directory\n\n- Enhanced ApiKeyMiddleware:\n  - Added environment variable support (JOBRUNNER_API_KEY)\n  - Added proper logging\n  - Improved error messages\n\nSecurity and scalability improvements for production readiness.\n\nCo-authored-by: larsbuch <larsbuch@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"692fb89b1f62ca98e6e93cd5ec23326e326b9b76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/git/trees/692fb89b1f62ca98e6e93cd5ec23326e326b9b76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/git/commits/1e2af2da572594a3f2d0977c1a2e5049a6770dd0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220374863?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mistral-vibe","id":220374863,"login":"mistral-vibe","node_id":"U_kgDODSKnTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/commit/1e2af2da572594