ment variables (JOBRUNNER_API_KEY)\n  - Falls back to configuration if environment variable not set\n  - Added proper logging for security events\n  - Improved error messages\n- Removed hardcoded API key from appsettings files\n- Added Health Checks infrastructure:\n  - Added Microsoft.Extensions.Diagnostics.HealthChecks packages\n  - Created DatabaseHealthCheck for EF Core connectivity\n  - Created QuartzHealthCheck for scheduler status\n  - Added /health endpoint\n  - Registered all health checks in Startup\n- Removed TODO comments and replaced with clarifying comments\n- Added QUICK_WINS_PLAN.md with implementation roadmap\n\nSecurity improvements:\n- API keys no longer stored in source control\n- More secure key management via environment variables\n- Better logging for security auditing\n\nObservability improvements:\n- Health check endpoint for monitoring\n- Database connectivity monitoring\n- Quartz scheduler monitoring\n\nCo-authored-by: larsbuch <larsbuch@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d04bf0e1315353f8bae017b0ab661afacc4b837","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/git/trees/0d04bf0e1315353f8bae017b0ab661afacc4b837"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DevelApp-ai/PluginJobRunner/git/commits/718c7445b8f06b3e06c96c1fe4766478fca18bf7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220374863?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mistral-vibe","id":220374863,"login":"mistral-vibe","node_id":"U_kgDODSKnTw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mistral-vibe/orgs","received_events_url"