followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko","id":8589105,"login":"WolfSoko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODkxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/011701b58564a15ac9abca0d51d166bfc648a346/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:42:30Z","email":"8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wolfram Sokollek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T16:42:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(ws-thanos): add snap sound, GPU rendering and crumble variants (#2420)\n\n- play a sound while vaporizing: the element breaks with a crunch and a\n  rumble, then a growing wind carries crackling sand that fades away\n- simulate and draw the particles on the GPU with WebGL2, one particle per\n  device pixel, with a CPU canvas fallback\n- new crumble variants: dust, cracks, shards (default) and chunks\n- override options per element with the wsThanosOptions input\n- place the effect over the element instead of the parent''s corner\n- demo page with crumble variants and a playground\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the snap sound is on by default, disable it with\n`provideWsThanosOptions({ sound: false })`. Elements crumble into shards by\ndefault, use `crumble: ''dust''` for the previous look. The default\n`maxParticleCount` is now 1500000, without WebGL2 at most 400000 are used.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"67b9e8327f955cc4a5c41756e45a7ca8481da544","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/67b9e8327f955cc4a5c41756e45a7ca8481da544"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/011701b58564a15ac9abca0d51d166bfc648a346","verification":{"payload":"tree 67b9e8327f955cc4a5c41756e45a7ca8481da544\nparent 91f86b72a35072ad2eaae5e1d2fdf1befcdd40fb\nauthor Wolfram Sokollek <8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com> 1791218550 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791218550 +0200\n\nfeat(ws-thanos): add snap sound, GPU rendering and crumble variants (#2420)\n\n- play a sound while vaporizing: the element breaks with a crunch and a\n  rumble, then a growing wind carries crackling sand that fades away\n- simulate and draw the particles on the GPU with WebGL2, one particle per\n  device pixel, with a CPU canvas fallback\n- new crumble variants: dust, cracks, shards (default) and chunks\n- override options per element with the wsThanosOptions input\n- place the effect over the element instead of the parent''s corner\n- demo page with crumble variants and a playground\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the snap sound is on by default, disable it with\n`provideWsThanosOptions({ sound: false })`. Elements crumble into shards by\ndefault, use `crumble: ''dust''` for the previous look. The default\n`maxParticleCount` is now 1500000, without WebGL2 at most 400000 are used.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqw9N2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXNMQAJoL1E/o/j5OB3yBkF4lE7U+\nnvHrtqp6hMk1jC8GRTdZdeJ1D8/o9S+GeiHy1ge/m7B74XwuoMlBz04TTf3KKIla\nyxv2uA6TsA1xuaHgqXzXf90oFvergBLi7AiyLnSqSXDxJ2uhVU7/fv1R1OppawJA\nD1umsdhB/wIOVIy06UlaeeAglrI/yIbpJnhGWia7pWmT/JiM5qf1bc0Wb8MpRSdY\nzJpkW6o0gjqSN4/B/k8ETytn/laufxcxRgb6MDk8+28hZ5Rl/XPLjwz6eSWX3Zc6\nVstjHoU1WdwMMwMNHQikvozr6mtBXAe81MJN