7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/5f3f77653f2b415a97e1b24c72bc0b6a83d4bda7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/8566d50289cc1f8aba209b3a038fab756f4f5675","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/8566d50289cc1f8aba209b3a038fab756f4f5675","node_id":"C_kwDOGZF_39oAKDg1NjZkNTAyODljYzFmOGFiYTIwOWIzYTAzOGZhYjc1NmY0ZjU2NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/8600911ed8da449f933778c5b88e4c81b1cc14ed","sha":"8600911ed8da449f933778c5b88e4c81b1cc14ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/8600911ed8da449f933778c5b88e4c81b1cc14ed"}],"sha":"8566d50289cc1f8aba209b3a038fab756f4f5675","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/8566d50289cc1f8aba209b3a038fab756f4f5675"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8589105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko","id":8589105,"login":"WolfSoko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODkxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/8600911ed8da449f933778c5b88e4c81b1cc14ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:07:21Z","email":"8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wolfram Sokollek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:07:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(cicd): 🐛 drop nitro node_modules before functions predeploy install (#2407)\n\nThe analog/nitro build emits `server/node_modules` with symlinks into\n`node_modules/.nitro/<pkg>@<version>` for packages that exist in several\nversions. npm 11 (arborist) crashes on that tree with\n\"Cannot read properties of null (reading ''fsTop'')\", so the\n`npm --prefix $RESOURCE_DIR install --omit dev` predeploy hook fails and\nevery non-cdk deploy since v31.0.0 aborted at rollapolla-analog.\n\nRemove the generated node_modules first and let npm install a clean tree\nfrom the generated package.json. firebase-tools ignores node_modules when\nuploading functions source, so nothing deployed changes. Reproduced\nlocally with node 24.21 / npm 11.19 against the real build output; with\nthe rm the install succeeds and firebase-functions resolves.\n\nApplied to pacetrainer as well, which uses the same predeploy hook.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8ab9ce550d52773a417b959b8d8abb81e641165","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/f8ab9ce550d52773a417b959b8d8abb81e641165"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/8600911ed8da449f933778c5b88e4c81b1cc14ed","verification":{"payload":"tree f8ab9ce550d52773a417b959b8d8abb81e641165\nparent f142f85ee104b4c2b4c5865f81765ca07958863e\nauthor Wolfram Sokollek <8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com> 1790762841 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790762841 +0000\n\nfix(cicd): 🐛 drop nitro node_modules before functions predeploy install (#2407)\n\nThe analog/nitro build emits `server/node_modules` with symlinks into\n`node_modules/.nitro/<pkg>@<version>` for packages that exist in several\nversions. npm 11 (arborist) crashes on that tree with\n\"Cannot read properties of null (reading ''fsTop'')\", so the\n`npm --prefix $RESOURCE_DIR install --omit dev` predeploy hook fails and\nevery non-cdk deploy since v31.0.0 aborted at rollapolla-analog.\n\nRemove the generated node_modules first and let npm install a clean tree\nfrom the generated package.json. firebase-tools ignores node_modules when\nuploading functions source, so nothing deployed changes. Reproduced\nlocally with node 24.21 / npm 11.19 against the real build output; with\nthe rm the install succeeds and firebase-functions resolves.\n\nApplied to pacetrainer as well, which uses the same predeploy hook.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqvN9ZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAedcQAC3Nb1N9EcfQi9g053DtXrn/\nFihAkf9CL0QUGPhq/g7YSz8qFHfRP+saG3v6b3iUnNmnsbEzbYpNFmhcjZ5caMMD\nHyoG9FYKUeTV0/csdxgjJkc7vziT0VeO7ZIfuYNJzlxr0KMdx3kcWlQFM0ATFqti\nwLYX5Gywd/42+qWZGPJR/cc6oB4TnETfP9CKMeeprkaATSZH/fDj87s7Ynm9emrh\nSN8wxJ05/NinGWkYAo4f1pHpDdvwLyYD3NdIT0R612Ek6PPeqELsemrO8QhiPicR\niA8qIeLjhTEHn7qUYs/iQbSScxMzXji8fc7f+9I+7C6fXpoJw8D7SfOI6BY6o7HA\njTBSe+2euuy7Ylai2gnAzj6cX1JTMuQ8lZyHdSgBgBqOiF6j8PdhZfc9Cr02wcN3\n6YJJIRMN0OuCCDsICldGpl4kYAIJt3BFeVgRGG7tXXYHCH5f7t17Y68oq4DbXmvr\ncl6BZ88z43omf0NBskiB4en+E+OwFed6002DqMSve0bAGzI3bTxPOgM3cA1D+yfk\nADN0Kz7Wa8jbweIAsq4HWELIK1jspAExAK2LXzRa4qswD6GW0QvKnu99j17LZKQ7\niBmHQkfHhVwxOf69I3bO5O+8OPTCVufUQuzWQig2XzQFPVV2UlAua1lFOngMDjuh\nxYU70dXN8eLt/NwQRmXs\n=ZJBZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:07:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"http