TI0OGFhNjFhYjAxMWVkODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/e3e604077a574b2569e892ca8a0f6188fc7cfca0","sha":"e3e604077a574b2569e892ca8a0f6188fc7cfca0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/e3e604077a574b2569e892ca8a0f6188fc7cfca0"}],"sha":"03117b427596258a82b4fc31248aa61ab011ed82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/03117b427596258a82b4fc31248aa61ab011ed82"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8589105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko","id":8589105,"login":"WolfSoko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODkxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/e3e604077a574b2569e892ca8a0f6188fc7cfca0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:55:16Z","email":"8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wolfram Sokollek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:55:16Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): update all non-major dependencies (#2401)\n\n* fix(deps): update all non-major dependencies\n\n* fix(deps): 🐛 regenerate lockfile and fix fallout from non-major bump\n\nRenovate''s own lockfile update for this PR failed silently (the\n''renovate/artifacts'' check reported ''Artifact file update failure'')\n- package-lock.json still had the pre-bump versions for every\npackage in the diff, so npm ci rejected it outright.\n\nAlso:\n- p5 2.3.4 is a broken patch release: it changed its own type\n  exports (dropped the named Graphics export, removed touchStarted/\n  touchMoved/curveVertex from the p5 instance type, made P5 unusable\n  as a type namespace), breaking the build/lint of every lib using\n  p5.js (fourier-analysis, tensorflow-examples, reaction-diffusion,\n  neural-networks). Pinned p5 back to 2.3.3 rather than patching\n  four libraries around an upstream regression.\n- Updated the spa-cdk-stack CloudFormation snapshot to match\n  aws-cdk-lib''s new bucket-deployment defaults (nodejs22.x ->\n  nodejs24.x runtime, arm64 architecture, new asset hashes) that\n  came with the aws-cdk-lib bump in this PR.\n\nVerified: npm ci succeeds, and nx affected -t lint,lint-templates,\ntest,build passes for all 40 affected projects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J\n\n* fix(deps): 🐛 pin @playwright/test back to 1.56.1\n\n1.63.0 ships a new bundled WebKit build whose font rasterization\ndiffers enough from the existing baseline to fail the\nrollapolla-analog home.spec.ts ''has a cta to follow X'' screenshot\ntest in CI (chromium and firefox in the same run passed; only\nwebkit''s toHaveScreenshot diverged). Rather than regenerate a\nWebKit golden image I can''t produce here (this host can''t run\nPlaywright''s WebKit browser at all, per prior investigation),\npin back to the last known-good version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Renovate Bot GitHub <bot@renovateapp.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e23dbdf1667f140a00658ef3e37708dfabecd95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/9e23dbdf1667f140a00658ef3e37708dfabecd95"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/e3e604077a574b2569e892ca8a0f6188fc7cfca0","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e23dbdf1667f140a00658ef3e37708dfabecd95\nparent 403ea415a325f20341c1b3faa970f6a3d431074a\nauthor Wolfram Sokollek <8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com> 1790697316 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790697316 +0200\n\nfix(deps): update all non-major dependencies (#2401)\n\n* fix(deps): update all non-major dependencies\n\n* fix(deps): 🐛 regenerate lockfile and fix fallout from non-major bump\n\nRenovate''s own lockfile update for this PR failed silently (the\n''renovate/artifacts'' check reported ''Artifact file update failure'')\n- package-lock.json still had the pre-bump versions for every\npackage in the diff, so npm ci rejected it outright.\n\nAlso:\n- p5 2.3.4 is a broken patch release: it changed its own type\n  exports (dropped the named Graphics export, removed touchStarted/\n  touchMoved/curveVertex from the p5 instance type, made P5 unusable\n  as a type namespace), breaking the build/lint of every lib using\n  p5.js (fourier-analysis, tensorflow-examples, reaction-diffusion,\n  neural-networks). Pinned p5 back to 2.3.3 rather than patching\n  four libraries around an upstream regression.\n- Updated the spa-cdk-stack CloudFormation snapshot to match\n  aws-cdk-lib''s new bucket-deployment defaults (nodejs22.x ->\n  nodejs24.x runtime, arm64 architecture, new asset hashes) that\n  came with the aws-cdk-lib bump in this PR.\n\nVerified: npm ci succeeds, and nx affected -t lint,lint-templates,\ntest,build passes for all 40 affected projects.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J\n\n* fix(deps): 🐛 pin @playwright/test back to 1.56.1\n\n1.63.0 ships a new bundled WebKit build whose font rasterization\ndiffers enough from the existing baseline to fail the\nrollapolla-analog home.spec.ts ''has a cta to follow X'' screenshot\ntest in CI (chromium and firefox in the same run passed; only\nwebkit''s toHaveScreenshot diverged). Rather than regenerate a\nWebKit golden image I can''t produce here (this host can''t run\nPlaywright''s WebKit browser at all, per prior investigation),\npin back to the last known-good version.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Renovate Bot GitHub <bot@renovateapp.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqu99kCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS2YQADx21SAX78tABf+oM3Vf+xvX\nzBIuoAD6eJ34z0z+Y6uW/sonsl19POHgqCRokDOHs8tmp9WY0gTLO2zt38VjT1UG\nwFG1gTWe8HYEWYf/7SQOARcVhWpo9WpsCVR+x+0SHEReVpbRrUjWYuRXrrr/Qth7\ngVFF/XtIX/6ZuyQUBk72GKwG2Hv8QIEtNEyPy1nsSALBKDJO+q57JfnRHa91Qux+\nNeY9s4XOjvUYzvswnvu4dPcY+GaE5cjOMR4QyNRhSCvR3nkmytsdPghjU6rrf9IX\nRrFNyjIVWI/HzQB5qF2KuWMSQB/7JC5cH+IPCHC9icSD2zmB6OdffZjIZ0Yeqfvg\nV4CKXpmgYzMtKRTCVDLEPSe4EsBgE4adMu/TRY58xGb4KflOu35ULtjCLW9VU3bx\nO3LAdg1dB/csA7MAulR2P0qLrdETVHQLeoSOUdDxg6p9IhqMfjF4pmXDMpXlt0in\nwTNsWZxCQo0cYB6VjHXtDaSGXn+Q/vaNfejaECreDk2r1cz5sExWV4T9mUJQr7lz\nrwW1EV1zHW9ZWQeedYP4WuUP2FdfGqkyIfQXXLAjeW3Kdkt9lnX/ulUPWLQEq5Ap\nYc47IBWiLVpTx9TUaGRqXG3qpfUIKwhpbhctrLsoGFKWlyLDKhM/aCFES6xlSAwu\n4Xl5uhIuml1BGjF04/ma\n=gZvL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-29T15:55:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_ur