html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/127675c737d9752375325cbc530b9885344123ed","node_id":"C_kwDOGZF_39oAKDEyNzY3NWM3MzdkOTc1MjM3NTMyNWNiYzUzMGI5ODg1MzQ0MTIzZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/061d2e74e5e88b0cabc91a71f93d34bd4eba2c96","sha":"061d2e74e5e88b0cabc91a71f93d34bd4eba2c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/061d2e74e5e88b0cabc91a71f93d34bd4eba2c96"}],"sha":"127675c737d9752375325cbc530b9885344123ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/127675c737d9752375325cbc530b9885344123ed"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8589105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko","id":8589105,"login":"WolfSoko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODkxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/061d2e74e5e88b0cabc91a71f93d34bd4eba2c96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:25:00Z","email":"8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wolfram Sokollek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T15:25:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): install functions deps before firebase deploy for tools v15 (#2361)\n\nfirebase-tools v15 changed how it analyses function source code — it\nnow tries to resolve firebase-functions via node_modules in the\ncodebase source directory and fails with \"An unexpected error has\noccurred\" when the package is absent.\n\nBoth pacetrainer and rollapolla-analog use Nitro''s firebase preset\n(Gen 2) which bundles the SSR server but still generates a\npackage.json in dist/…/analog/server listing firebase-functions as a\ndependency.  Adding a predeploy hook that runs `npm install --omit=dev`\nin that directory causes firebase-tools to find the package before it\nanalyses the codebase, unblocking the deploy step.\n\nFixes #2359\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014YNqD1VQWy9cNJQuwQXDdq\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be6f11aeede656b797ce66a02009a98c4ba569be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/be6f11aeede656b797ce66a02009a98c4ba569be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/061d2e74e5e88b0cabc91a71f93d34bd4eba2c96","verification":{"payload":"tree be6f11aeede656b797ce66a02009a98c4ba569be\nparent eb0e5c510cb25ec60e5f5303b7e146c63bdce436\nauthor Wolfram Sokollek <8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com> 1790609100 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790609100 +0200\n\nfix(ci): install functions deps before firebase deploy for tools v15 (#2361)\n\nfirebase-tools v15 changed how it analyses function source code — it\nnow tries to resolve firebase-functions via node_modules in the\ncodebase source directory and fails with \"An unexpected error has\noccurred\" when the package is absent.\n\nBoth pacetrainer and rollapolla-analog use Nitro''s firebase preset\n(Gen 2) which bundles the SSR server but still generates a\npackage.json in dist/…/analog/server listing firebase-functions as a\ndependency.  Adding a predeploy hook that runs `npm install --omit=dev`\nin that directory causes firebase-tools to find the package before it\nanalyses the codebase, unblocking the deploy step.\n\nFixes #2359\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014YNqD1VQWy9cNJQuwQXDdq\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquobMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwQsQAKtCJ3Enb+JC0SBywk7yIrq4\n/c+8JhtuN+C7PWhe3wISMKCGP1vjvw9g6U6DYICVjtlBHpzFhgD7Squfq5Q8JQOM\nLwU/t1FRUWcs/Xg5pznGOj/vKeIQOUq/oefi2ik8ciF7JS1oXE+F0a+35X1NyRfp\n8lDQzLZOFoslO4Y0V0z0Mtasa7RzvMPUNUaWwN04qgjZFNRCq/JLYZGVOzIfhP0J\n6wOHsf53jIgTTKZXRkapUgu/xmiTnyFyBZE7jt4VSZpraiSXBnxuMjX07vidk1qX\nesWB9aEuQ/NFUd86tmwPlIQFH9YVQ3LudFa4QVLJdQbsEzypCXqul59G0gyzke7b\np8wfkd8Gu6nT3TJUZbw2bF6gmj6r+ntX1foTbrE5jGQEVVNnPpcyUP4Sftrd4j4A\nbpQRo8tlJ99iplZusuQNaIYwHEJKlmihXTprKvo8YEoQWgUX04Dtiuein0VilaB1\nR9UHLoGuy6JanBA5kWuaWLnz3kx6+UXSO8CLneR8GOf4diP9/dEKe9oYI/a/qQ6k\ndONanKAUHmqYVuYLB+2+oZZ9V7BQdsCoxbY6xMOASAg9VZIuMvLqAAsvQu4yJlLR\nAiz2sH6aaYd2oJVlJgQqIU4NFwU/7zO0VSjDsbeQ8sqStWZgRbn5iRl91i/7hAor\nl5qMBl6eREPvby7NKV1G\n=FsCm\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T15:25:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gith