no/commit/4a87046fefea0ea9651a53562866743ea97624b8","node_id":"C_kwDOGZF_39oAKDRhODcwNDZmZWZlYTBlYTk2NTFhNTM1NjI4NjY3NDNlYTk3NjI0Yjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/c434419f2ac034ba536a01f06160bcd9ee490107","sha":"c434419f2ac034ba536a01f06160bcd9ee490107","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/c434419f2ac034ba536a01f06160bcd9ee490107"}],"sha":"4a87046fefea0ea9651a53562866743ea97624b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/4a87046fefea0ea9651a53562866743ea97624b8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8589105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko","id":8589105,"login":"WolfSoko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODkxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/c434419f2ac034ba536a01f06160bcd9ee490107/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T06:18:20Z","email":"8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wolfram Sokollek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T06:18:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(tools): generate architecture diagrams from the Nx project graph (#2369)\n\n* feat(tools): generate architecture diagrams from the Nx project graph\n\nAdd tools/architecture/generate-diagrams.mjs (npm run arch:diagrams) which\nwrites docs/architecture/README.md: layer overview, module boundary rules,\nNative Federation topology, full project dependency graph (Mermaid), modularity\nmetrics (fan-in/fan-out/instability) and automated findings (cycles, boundary\nviolations, unused or untagged libs). Output is deterministic so the file only\nchanges when the architecture does; `--check` fails when it is stale.\n\nThe weekly architecture routine regenerates these diagrams and links them\nfrom the pinned architecture tracking issue.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KPwmmc9RzS1LNLZjTwxLRj\n\n* fix(tools): match module boundary semantics in architecture report\n\n- Report imports from projects no depConstraint applies to as violations,\n  as @nx/enforce-module-boundaries does.\n- Drop the claim that a tag may always depend on itself; draw self-loops\n  only where a rule lists its own tag.\n- Fail instead of reporting \"no violations\" when no depConstraints exist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KPwmmc9RzS1LNLZjTwxLRj\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb788c97911c980092aaee425e6ce2b4d1378a87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/cb788c97911c980092aaee425e6ce2b4d1378a87"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/c434419f2ac034ba536a01f06160bcd9ee490107","verification":{"payload":"tree cb788c97911c980092aaee425e6ce2b4d1378a87\nparent fffdd13b85778a888ed2b2d5ee0b1de5cf206e54\nauthor Wolfram Sokollek <8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com> 1790317100 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790317100 +0200\n\nfeat(tools): generate architecture diagrams from the Nx project graph (#2369)\n\n* feat(tools): generate architecture diagrams from the Nx project graph\n\nAdd tools/architecture/generate-diagrams.mjs (npm run arch:diagrams) which\nwrites docs/architecture/README.md: layer overview, module boundary rules,\nNative Federation topology, full project dependency graph (Mermaid), modularity\nmetrics (fan-in/fan-out/instability) and automated findings (cycles, boundary\nviolations, unused or untagged libs). Output is deterministic so the file only\nchanges when the architecture does; `--check` fails when it is stale.\n\nThe weekly architecture routine regenerates these diagrams and links them\nfrom the pinned architecture tracking issue.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KPwmmc9RzS1LNLZjTwxLRj\n\n* fix(tools): match module boundary semantics in architecture report\n\n- Report imports from projects no depConstraint applies to as violations,\n  as @nx/enforce-module-boundaries does.\n- Drop the claim that a tag may always depend on itself; draw self-loops\n  only where a rule lists its own tag.\n- Fail instead of reporting \"no violations\" when no depConstraints exist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KPwmmc9RzS1LNLZjTwxLRj\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqthIsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT8QQAEKiR0G5hhP0liiCehZQbitg\n/N+1CS2q7A9ESqFgnk0AP6+B2/hZvhI9PqDbVg0Z0dH0S5NVQvXFzg9sa/5LGfxn\nzBCM7HSwqiiypWt1IMPB1NmqQhHF5SA3+0h0mOu6CC65xu0BJCG5ugR5jkJAqgD9\n0XViJaHMI8bIjJcNRIAIuswTgWYOcBg8qatYxX9plljPv4phsiF/KneCNPmF0zPw\nOjSBjbCYCk14JrDM286xgNEy6t9/E+y7c4kqw5jUiyQL7yzImEAbO9repXk1mUpb\nTF7iwrLSY+bcdRl++KsVHusQ+UiBDYVS12EG+ricZvfiJoYE88MNqcBf53cmL9lA\nakkeWqleA6ZAWv6THOaOIMBH9jipU05jQgY4+2v/OUsgwNvwTNZiyBsl9CM84BMU\n+W9lQPzcr3Hn1dgFABJPdob7YXQfXcOM3qc1op5xVmPDrqG0Eol+BBZQO0egxVzc\nuQG1zq+470ic7+u9/r6eYTEDPreMzDDoryueUTOeeOc7KIq7Aj+Zo4JUodag5CT4\nZCwcCQRYW/mIfW