comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:54:35Z","email":"github-actions[bot]@users.no-reply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"message":"chore(release): publish\n\n- project: nx-aws-cdk-v2 4.0.0","tree":{"sha":"0de9507b250b2ff51f8fc472eeaffefce9e2f9f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/0de9507b250b2ff51f8fc472eeaffefce9e2f9f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/85155e91fd5c440644b5c8f3630b03927c9928be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/85155e91fd5c440644b5c8f3630b03927c9928be","node_id":"C_kwDOGZF_39oAKDg1MTU1ZTkxZmQ1YzQ0MDY0NGI1YzhmMzYzMGIwMzkyN2M5OTI4YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/081addb80ae23a69a5330d6eb2e1d8453b780e50","sha":"081addb80ae23a69a5330d6eb2e1d8453b780e50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/081addb80ae23a69a5330d6eb2e1d8453b780e50"}],"sha":"85155e91fd5c440644b5c8f3630b03927c9928be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/85155e91fd5c440644b5c8f3630b03927c9928be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8589105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko","id":8589105,"login":"WolfSoko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODkxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/081addb80ae23a69a5330d6eb2e1d8453b780e50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:49:36Z","email":"8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wolfram Sokollek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:49:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(nx-aws-cdk-v2)!: run CDK apps through tsx and the package manager''s exec (#2355)\n\nThe CDK deploys have failed on every release since v4.107.0. The executors ran a\nCDK app''s main.ts through `ts-node --require tsconfig-paths/register`, and\ntsconfig-paths resolves `paths` only when `baseUrl` is set — which was dropped\nfrom tsconfig.base.json in 26984fc3, so every CDK app lost its workspace\naliases with `Cannot find module ''@wolsok/spa-cdk-stack''`. Restoring `baseUrl`\nis not the way out: TypeScript 6 deprecates it (TS5101).\n\n`tsx --tsconfig <project>/tsconfig.app.json` replaces it. tsx resolves the\nproject''s tsconfig `paths` itself and handles CommonJS and ESM alike, so the\nmodule-type detection is gone. `--tsconfig` is not optional: without it tsx\nreads whatever tsconfig sits next to the working directory, which is why the\npre-existing ESM branch was latently broken too, as were this workspace''s own\nfour cdk.json files.\n\nThe package manager prefix now comes from the devkit''s\n`getPackageManagerCommand().exec` instead of being derived by hand. The old\n`packageManager === ''npm'' ? ''npx'' : packageManager` produced `pnpm tsx`, which\npnpm reads as a script name rather than a binary. The devkit reports `npx`,\n`pnpm exec` (`pnpx` on older pnpm), `yarn` and `bun`.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the executors now require `tsx` and no longer use `ts-node` or\n`tsconfig-paths`. The init generator installs `tsx` (it already did) and stops\ninstalling the other two, and `TS_NODE_VERSION` and `TSCONFIG_PATHS_VERSION` are\nno longer exported. Workspaces that relied on those packages being installed as\na side effect of this plugin need to add them themselves.\n\nVerified: the command the executor builds now synthesizes all four CDK apps in\nthis workspace up to the point where AWS credentials would be needed — no module\nresolution errors. Plugin unit tests (20) and the nx-aws-cdk-v2-e2e suite, which\nCI does not run, both pass. The deploy itself needs the next release to confirm.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J","tree":{"sha":"6b0ee32b90785698faf8051aca8417b4439ab08f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/6b0ee32b90785698faf8051aca8417b4439ab08f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/081addb80ae23a69a5330d6eb2e1d8453b780e50","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b0ee32b90785698faf8051aca8417b4439ab08f\nparent 89196a133eeb22987799cd8efa01014d7f6443d8\nauthor Wolfram Sokollek <8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com> 1789627776 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789627776 +0200\n\nfeat(nx-aws-cdk-v2)!: run CDK apps through tsx and the package manager''s exec (#2355)\n\nThe CDK deploys have failed on every release since v4.107.0. The executors ran a\nCDK app''s main.ts through `ts-node --require tsconfig-paths/register`, and\ntsconfig-paths resolves `paths` only when `baseUrl` is set — which was dropped\nfrom tsconfig.base.json in 26984fc3, so every CDK app lost its workspace\naliases with `Cannot find module ''@wolsok/spa-cdk-stack''`. Restoring `baseUrl`\nis not the way out: TypeScript 6 deprecates it (TS5101).\n\n`tsx --tsconfig <project>/tsconfig.app.json` replaces it. tsx resolves the\nproject''s tsconfig `paths` itself and handles CommonJS and ESM alike, so the\nmodule-type detection is gone. `--tsconfig` is not optional: without it tsx\nreads whatever tsconfig sits next to the working directory, which is why the\npre-existing ESM branch was latently broken too, as were this workspace''s own\nfour cdk.json files.\n\nThe package manager prefix now comes from the devkit''s\n`getPackageManagerCommand().exec` instead of being derived by hand. The old\n`packageManager === ''npm'' ? ''npx'' : packageManager` produced `pnpm tsx`, which\npnpm reads as a script name rather than a binary. The devkit reports `npx`,\n`pnpm exec` (`pnpx` on older pnpm), `yarn` and `bun`.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: the executors now require `tsx` and no longer use `ts-node` or\n`tsconfig-paths`. The init generator installs `tsx` (it already did) and stops\ninstalling the other two, and `TS_NODE_VERSION` and `TSCONFIG_PATHS_VERSION` are\nno longer exported. Workspaces that relied on those packages being installed as\na side effect of this plugin need to add them themselves.\n\nVerified: the command the executor builds now synthesizes all four CDK apps in\nthis workspace up to the point where AWS credentials would be needed — no module\nresolution errors. Plugin unit tests (20) and the nx-aws-cdk-v2-e2e suite, which\nCI does not run, both pass. The deploy itself needs the next release to confirm.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq42ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADTQQADPwfwMO1IFwt/IjZWSltwbn\nVL/ULJcdRXnWiPmnZwHoFQ33gddyIqJ2Hes8K/M/286edGHmOAXuf11pAJRcXSF8\ncywkDCopRpfx6ZLrj49Kzuuy8gaUCDIma2zoKTkNHWzZEGF0JYDVsnZYhLVoZk83\nK6ShnPp2bZAFZ52ptw0qflCqIJcpOdrGimkiCBj0FWeaPPrgVj3/H4qEwu4L5X+d\nsy7TEzvE6EPM93ygmIcM8/jl7nNbRudhAswEG/rLZhsUxSjvblAtalnvuWYU/oMQ\nh2lNR3Nkdy658bbyJ0W0SgB8VNP0FMemESuQ1Ai7fEOINKyBsTzAJw1T8xmHzYat\nnRnlS7wA3RF3hiB8+2+5KjhIlFIBErGdAcjIS8AfJvFlHQDPsa+6Dmxjyaa6aUjB\nmozpLASv8NXHf2frfaOUUQCdETPHEy4VGOm2DQTq+gGXuYoROsM6/uTq4FTOY3V+\nCV2yFR1tW