ents","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:32:43Z","email":"github-actions[bot]@users.no-reply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:32:43Z","email":"github-actions[bot]@users.no-reply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"message":"chore(release): 4.110.0 [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"cd3ae878df222facd0179e265278be8583296022","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/cd3ae878df222facd0179e265278be8583296022"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/89196a133eeb22987799cd8efa01014d7f6443d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/89196a133eeb22987799cd8efa01014d7f6443d8","node_id":"C_kwDOGZF_39oAKDg5MTk2YTEzM2VlYjIyOTg3Nzk5Y2Q4ZWZhMDEwMTRkN2Y2NDQzZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commit/571e5e2b12d4f46f73d2dcca2f0da07c7cf8ac25","sha":"571e5e2b12d4f46f73d2dcca2f0da07c7cf8ac25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/571e5e2b12d4f46f73d2dcca2f0da07c7cf8ac25"}],"sha":"89196a133eeb22987799cd8efa01014d7f6443d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/89196a133eeb22987799cd8efa01014d7f6443d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8589105?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/WolfSoko","id":8589105,"login":"WolfSoko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1ODkxMDU=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/WolfSoko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/commits/571e5e2b12d4f46f73d2dcca2f0da07c7cf8ac25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:26:38Z","email":"8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Wolfram Sokollek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:26:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): migrate to Angular 22, TypeScript 6 and Node 24 (#2352)\n\nAngular 20.3.7 -> 22.1.6, TypeScript 5.9.3 -> 6.0.3, Node 22.22.2 -> 24.21.0,\nAnalog 1.22.1 -> 2.7.2, native-federation 20 -> 22.1.3. Nx was already on 23.2.1.\n\nAngular was upgraded in two steps: the 21 migration collections of\n@angular/core and @schematics/angular are dropped from the 22 packages, so a\ndirect 20 -> 22 jump would have silently skipped ten migrations.\n\nAngular 22 requires typescript >=6.0 <6.1, so TS goes to 6.0.3 — not 7.x.\n\nTwo latent bugs surfaced in nx-aws-cdk-v2, both hidden by an implicit any:\nstacks was typed string[] while schema.json declares a string and executor.util\nchecks typeof === ''string''; and projects[context.projectName] indexed with a\npossibly-undefined key, collapsing the expression to any and silencing every\nerror downstream. A resolveProjectPaths() helper replaces the four duplicated\nblocks and fails loudly instead of yielding undefined paths.\n\nNative federation 20 -> 22 broke the shell and the remotes in two ways:\n- nf 22 infers the platform of every shared bundle from the shared dependency\n  names, and a root @angular/ssr / @angular/platform-server entry flips it to\n  ''node'' — so firebase/firestore resolved to its Node build and imported the\n  builtin `util`, which an import map cannot provide. Pinned to ''browser''.\n- nf 22 prunes unused deps by scanning `exposes` rather than the main.ts graph,\n  dropping @angular/platform-browser/animations from the remotes'' import maps\n  while esbuild kept the bare import. Fixed with includeSecondaries.\nnx.json gains the federation config as a shared global input; it was an input to\nnothing, so editing it invalidated no cache.\n\nNode 24 brings npm 11.19, which blocks dependency install scripts unless listed\nin the new allowScripts field. gl is denied there: it builds through NAN, whose\nv8::ScriptOrigin constructors no longer exist in Node 24''s V8, and there is no\nNode 24 prebuild. It only serves gpu.js''s Node headless-GL path, which nothing\nhere uses; browser WebGL is unaffected.\n\nFurther adjustments the upgrade forced: the four ts-jest projects move to\nmodule/moduleResolution node16 (TS5107); ws-thanos-test-app loses an\nextendedDiagnostics block that Angular rejects next to strictTemplates:false\n(NG4003); angular-examples widens its Jest transform for @softarc/native-federation,\nnow shipped as ESM; both Analog apps switch to the vitest-angular `test` builder,\nwhose build-test counterpart cannot load under Node ESM; both exclude the\nschematics-only devkit packages from optimizeDeps, which Analog 2''s\nauto-discover-deps plugin otherwise drags into the browser bundle; Material 21''s\nremoved MAT_TOOLTIP_SCROLL_STRATEGY_FACTORY_PROVIDER is dropped; and three\nselectors that equal their lint prefix carry a targeted disable rather than\nbeing renamed, since wsThanos is published API of @wolsok/thanos.\n\nAlso drops 46 precautionary extendedDiagnostics suppressions the migration added\n(the workspace reports no NG81xx diagnostics without them) and moves\nangular-examples to the fetch HttpClient backend and ws-thanos-test-app to the\napplication builder.\n\nVerified: build 34/34, test 35/35, lint and lint-templates 39/39, format,\nsync, and the e2e suites for the shell and both remotes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J","tree":{"sha":"92f7ac30be0a50f47cca5403b4fbe284cbff5401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/trees/92f7ac30be0a50f47cca5403b4fbe284cbff5401"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/WolfSoko/wol-sok-mono/git/commits/571e5e2b12d4f46f73d2dcca2f0da07c7cf8ac25","verification":{"payload":"tree 92f7ac30be0a50f47cca5403b4fbe284cbff5401\nparent 8e13eda4ac398fcef930a2392868f2fce2763bac\nauthor Wolfram Sokollek <8589105+WolfSoko@users.noreply.github.com> 1789586798 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789586798 +0200\n\nchore(deps): migrate to Angular 22, TypeScript 6 and Node 24 (#2352)\n\nAngular 20.3.7 -> 22.1.6, TypeScript 5.9.3 -> 6.0.3, Node 22.22.2 -> 24.21.0,\nAnalog 1.22.1 -> 2.7.2, native-federation 20 -> 22.1.3. Nx was already on 23.2.1.\n\nAngular was upgraded in two steps: the 21 migration collections of\n@angular/core and @schematics/angular are dropped from the 22 packages, so a\ndirect 20 -> 22 jump would have silently skipped ten migrations.\n\nAngular 22 requires typescript >=6.0 <6.1, so TS goes to 6.0.3 — not 7.x.\n\nTwo latent bugs surfaced in nx-aws-cdk-v2, both hidden by an implicit any:\nstacks was typed string[] while schema.json declares a string and executor.util\nchecks typeof === ''string''; and projects[context.projectName] indexed with a\npossibly-undefined key, collapsing the expression to any and silencing every\nerror downstream. A resolveProjectPaths() helper replaces the four duplicated\nblocks and fails loudly instead of yielding undefined paths.\n\nNative federation 20 -> 22 broke the shell and the remotes in two ways:\n- nf 22 infers the platform of every shared bundle from the shared dependency\n  names, and a root @angular/ssr / @angular/platform-server entry flips it to\n  ''node'' — so firebase/firestore resolved to its Node build and imported the\n  builtin `util`, which an import map cannot provide. Pinned to ''browser''.\n- nf 22 prunes unused deps by scanning `exposes` rather than the main.ts graph,\n  dropping @angular/platform-browser/animations from the remotes'' import maps\n  while esbuild kept the bare import. Fixed with includeSecondaries.\nnx.json gains the federation config as a shared global input; it was an input to\nnothing, so editing it invalidated no cache.\n\nNode 24 brings npm 11.19, which blocks dependency install scripts unless listed\nin the new allowScripts field. gl is denied there: it builds through NAN, whose\nv8::ScriptOrigin constructors no longer exist in Node 24''s V8, and there is no\nNode 24 prebuild. It only serves gpu.js''s Node headless-GL path, which nothing\nhere uses; browser WebGL is unaffected.\n\nFurther adjustments the upgrade forced: the four ts-jest projects move to\nmodule/moduleResolution node16 (TS5107); ws-thanos-test-app loses an\nextendedDiagnostics block that Angular rejects next to strictTemplates:false\n(NG4003); angular-examples widens its Jest transform for @softarc/native-federation,\nnow shipped as ESM; both Analog apps switch to the vitest-angular `test` builder,\nwhose build-test counterpart cannot load under Node ESM; both exclude the\nschematics-only devkit packages from optimizeDeps, which Analog 2''s\nauto-discover-deps plugin otherwise drags into the browser bundle; Material 21''s\nremoved MAT_TOOLTIP_SCROLL_STRATEGY_FACTORY_PROVIDER is dropped; and three\nselectors that equal their lint prefix carry a targeted disable rather than\nbeing renamed, since wsThanos is published API of @wolsok/thanos.\n\nAlso drops 46 precautionary extendedDiagnostics suppressions the migration added\n(the workspace reports no NG81xx diagnostics without them) and moves\nangular-examples to the fetch HttpClient backend and ws-thanos-test-app to the\napplication builder.\n\nVerified: build 34/34, test 35/35, lint and lint-templates 39/39, format,\nsync, and the e2e suites for the shell and both remotes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UWtntsc1SXkv41A6qaXm1J","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqu1uCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABuYQAIWpuK60GgoEomzFKq/yUynx\nRIJrUm8edofiS9JTFtx0ua7oOWsC3M3+GYCW3lH5WuEW8wwGsXHmy1Gpq/tJEUh3\nGMjxU98UNaAcebN9rih6xy0KD1CsyTdahetlKVmuQkkdTifuYELftnDL5WYDqcxA\nFum5jayBwG5f7GStvIDWkjehT3fxAqO1fe+C6yyYk8/HTFVlsEYNE8GqefoEPfHw\n/ZCqIoKCEk2/o5CiRFm+rzX8y6mnbERM5IS3QQnz1IIcLZ2xPW223fEEiPuQeI+c\n+3rbM+HZ0iwdXQ4csbE4Vm+dHP/hQ9yblJyZZ3RWCpMXZWH53fBeH0gt6zZ2jJJn\nW381sSIiAj0BIVZo3MPiwfd01QOHc0ClTOqy05dsT9XuroHn6Y2Ay+RLnEmC2diB\nCxOrMbgXkS7dh1VUML9gOQSC9K7dPuur2Ko3EpBY7PELiiLqcxcRm7SXjWjcpOh8\nncwcgy4RlKnwQplxx/JySb2+A/+7CSynM0zYhtn+Wdje3ftydwOtuebjlC1dSisR\nvWQC4oueZWMMMxELb3h3HaepJSZwVRJhTLmSs8QppCTJEFoWKq659LaWWtMwTZiR\nMPc33uA0zWcPEDl8/zaHtuzIgjXck88yvWAU9zdlPU4iiG1p02woUMsgD5IiApgV\nc6KAUpozFmUEzIOTODKG\n=MEDq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T19:26:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url