ostgres\n\n* prevent submit twice on bcprovider creation, mock fetch for testing pharmacy pages\n\n* aria-label updates\n\n* link, comparison, docker-compose postgres updates\n\n* chore: stop tracking run-sonar scripts and ignore them\n\n* fix last 2 sonarcloud \"errors\"\n\n* add helm dependency build charts/pidp\n\n* reduce duplicate lines to keep sonarqube happy\n\n* mistake from trying to please the 3 percent duplication rule\n\n* add helm dependency build\n\n* disable trivy, more testing required\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: emiliobarriosr-cgi <emilio.barriosramirez@cgi.com>","tree":{"sha":"b02769fcbc54b597c5d226d48837a783c17589fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/git/trees/b02769fcbc54b597c5d226d48837a783c17589fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/git/commits/36b6fc28e4b67775ed564894e783f1f91fda7537","verification":{"payload":"tree b02769fcbc54b597c5d226d48837a783c17589fe\nparent 02516a2290f91192c611295dcefcd2faef622c96\nauthor Dane Watson <dane.watson@cgi.com> 1787033885 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787033885 -0700\n\nfeature/imms-pharmadmin (#753)\n\n* poc-pharm-workflow\n\n* updates for immsbc-pharmadmin jul31\n\n* additional form work/UX improvements\n\n* pharmacy backend updates\n\n* codequality feedback\n\n* fix up after code quality improvement\n\n* sonarqube feedback updates\n\n* fix missing pkg ref\n\n* UX updates\n\n* revert onkeyup\n\n* fix required fields for form submission\n\n* feature/HCIMWeb-Card\n\n* HCIM Web App card Front end with DEMO flag\n\n* Update text for HCIMWeb/PCR card\n\n* Changes to match PAS login flow\n\n* Authorization fixes and front end PCR card improvements\n\n* Migrations for PCR AccessTypeCode\n\n* AccessType for PCR Db context\n\n* Add endpoint for Access Type + Keycloak role assignment for BCProvider Credential\n\n* Changes on front end to link to backend + add button step to request access to PCR (Keycloak role assignment)\n\n* sonarqube alerts\n\n* Feature/RSV car