le removal due tu deprecation.\n\n* jest update package to angular 21 compatible\n\n* injection instead of constructor based parameters\n\n* fix nx run shared-ui:lint issues related to eslint\n\n* Missing syntax changes of Angular 21 and fixing nx run pidp:lint errors\n\n* missing testbed configurations\n\n* Sonarqube alerts\n\n* eslint, jest and sonarqube alerts\n\n* BCMOHAD-32016 - Remove unused college_licence_info attribute from Keycloak\n\n* Sonarqube aria-label missing in html inputs\n\n* Alerts\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Dane Watson <dane.watson@cgi.com>","tree":{"sha":"d456612716d3008e76350ebf1aae71681d445f5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/git/trees/d456612716d3008e76350ebf1aae71681d445f5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/git/commits/14a2ee16a02960f5d2e724c173421d41ed4b6831","verification":{"payload":"tree d456612716d3008e76350ebf1aae71681d445f5f\nparent c5ce97d4c15a0eab113b00cb8bb54e35f721cc49\nauthor emiliobarriosr-cgi <emilio.barriosramirez@cgi.com> 1781893787 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781893787 -0700\n\nFeature/angular 21 (#745)\n\n* Angular 20\n\n* Changes for Angular 21 migration,\n\nSyntax changes on Ifs, loops. Package resolutions, note that in package.json \"caniuse-lite\": \"^1.0.30001792\" - currently issue loading user-access agreement. Not ready for merging\n\n* fix for display on some pages such as user agreement\n\n* fixes on rendering of some components\n\n* Update ngx-mask from ~17.0.4 to ~21.0.0\n\n* keycloak angular and keycloak js versions upgrade\n\n* dependencies resolutions to address security risks\n\n* Update eslint to angular 21 version\n\n* Update to Node version 22 and update some packages to appropiate versions\n\n* Sonarqube alerts\n\n* Sonarqube warning fix, eslint injection as warning instead od error, no-extra-semi rule removal due tu deprecation.\n\n* jest update package to angular 21 compatible\n\n* injection instead of constructor based parameters\n\n* fix n