aahn","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MTMyODg3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paahn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paahn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paahn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paahn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paahn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Paahn","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/commits/5702d633e3364f8ba6dad75b54f6af896ed8b808/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-23T18:42:47Z","email":"45132887+Paahn@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Panos Hatzinikolaou"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-23T18:42:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"OHID-330 Angular 19 (#738)\n\n* correct type after deprecation\n\n* Revert \"correct type after deprecation\"\n\nThis reverts commit 26f6c0316d2d144c4faa68974762b19dc8f0dc13.\n\n* angular 19\n\n* correct type after deprecation\n\n* all components, services, directives, pipes are standalone by default\n\n* replace deprecated APP_INITIALIZER\n\n* turn off prefer standalone linting as its now default\n\n* Replace usage of getJestProjects with getJestProjectsAsync\n\n* tags and continuous=true\n\n* mat change\n\n* update gitignore\n\n* update fontawesome\n\n* update keycloak libs\n\n* init keycloak library in bundler\n\n* unused\n\n* Fixes Dart scss warnings\n\n* Revert \"Fixes Dart scss warnings\"\n\nThis reverts commit 9ed1645b4ff64b73fc6d9a7c3b2e93e3ebd130c7.\n\n* downgrade sass to supress warnings\n\n* package updates\n\n* linting\n\n* deprecated test setup\n\n* es2022 to use bundler for moduleResolution\n\n* test class\n\n* new keycloak options type\n\n* routerTestingModule deprecation\n\n* tests pass\n\n* init new keycloak\n\n* migrate to using new keycloak\n\n* use env vars\n\n* fix tests from keycloak deprecation\n\n* sonarcloud comments\n\n* edit regex to not match empty string\n\n* compiler changed for tests\n\n* include\n\n* edit path\n\n* add bundler in spite of extending base\n\n* add Bundler to compilerOptions\n\n* remove dupl\n\n* add types to package.json\n\n* add lib to tests tsconfig\n\n* types\n\n* remove types def\n\n* downgrade minor version of keycloakjs\n\n* downgradex2\n\n* test\n\n* downgradex3\n\n* x4\n\n* downgrade to keycloak-js 25\n\n* move null checking\n\n* rename\n\n* test session expiry\n\n* session expiry 5 min\n\n* re-format\n\n* roles parsed from token\n\n* Keycloack configuration missing for environment fetch\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Rajesh Shrestha <yesjesh@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Roya Shourouni <roya.shourouni@gov.bc.ca>\nCo-authored-by: James Hollinger <jameshollinger.ee@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Emilio Barrios Ramirez <emilio.barriosramirez_cgi@outlook.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0d28b5a2e0a8149480cb1a2dedfba82820262ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/git/trees/c0d28b5a2e0a8149480cb1a2dedfba82820262ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/git/commits/5702d633e3364f8ba6dad75b54f6af896ed8b808","verification":{"payload":"tree c0d28b5a2e0a8149480cb1a2dedfba82820262ff\nparent 1a61a17abaae06bab0c6f1f615c2fe595d9bc8f7\nauthor Panos Hatzinikolaou <45132887+Paahn@users.noreply.github.com> 1776969767 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776969767 -0700\n\nOHID-330 Angular 19 (#738)\n\n* correct type after deprecation\n\n* Revert \"correct type after deprecation\"\n\nThis reverts commit 26f6c0316d2d144c4faa68974762b19dc8f0dc13.\n\n* angular 19\n\n* correct type after deprecation\n\n* all components, services, directives, pipes are standalone by default\n\n* replace deprecated APP_INITIALIZER\n\n* turn off prefer standalone linting as its now default\n\n* Replace usage of getJestProjects with getJestProjectsAsync\n\n* tags and continuous=true\n\n* mat change\n\n* update gitignore\n\n* update fontawesome\n\n* update keycloak libs\n\n* init keycloak library in bundler\n\n* unused\n\n* Fixes Dart scss warnings\n\n* Revert \"Fixes Dart scss warnings\"\n\nThis reverts commit 9ed1645b4ff64b73fc6d9a7c3b2e93e3ebd130c7.\n\n* downgrade sass to supress warnings\n\n* package updates\n\n* linting\n\n* deprecated test setup\n\n* es2022 to use bundler for moduleResolution\n\n* test class\n\n* new keycloak options type\n\n* routerTestingModule deprecation\n\n* tests pass\n\n* init new keycloak\n\n* migrate to using new keycloak\n\n* use env vars\n\n* fix tests from keycloak deprecation\n\n* sonarcloud comments\n\n* edit regex to not match empty string\n\n* compiler changed for tests\n\n* include\n\n* edit path\n\n* add bundler in spite of extending base\n\n* add Bundler to compilerOptions\n\n* remove dupl\n\n* add types to package.json\n\n* add lib to tests tsconfig\n\n* types\n\n* remove types def\n\n* downgrade minor version of keycloakjs\n\n* downgradex2\n\n* test\n\n* downgradex3\n\n* x4\n\n* downgrade to keycloak-js 25\n\n* move null checking\n\n* rename\n\n* test session expiry\n\n* session expiry 5 min\n\n* re-format\n\n* roles parsed from token\n\n* Keycloack configuration missing for environment fetch\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Rajesh Shrestha <yesjesh@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Roya Shourouni <roya.shourouni@gov.bc.ca>\nCo-authored-by: James Hollinger <jameshollinger.ee@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Emilio Barrios Ramirez <emilio.barriosramirez_cgi@outlook.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp6mgnCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnm8QAIQv+OQ7OPlBq3aodarPC5Mu\nyGtu2FhtaRFjpDk9kM+myVysKgd4JEJQjC/zucEIEmOevrZ3S36sVUzBm8BJEBJn\nnhkySEiK4k0bYgeMZjh+09qW1loGDyJX5zl6Z9V2W4V3GlJHG11EZlv29F9lnzi4\nxVg/gbMkwicZyAxLU3wQNkQvZdazBKoR2CpQnqsmy2a24uJMidIa22NZ2oGhLMmT\n/wiyjtlmMsCc26YrQCHvJb/S2qJuIcccsmEbJ4gf23dHZhfuJwsdVhJIfzjDjxo8\nSUp5y86VTs0pkEzTgp6ticpnqFw8vFhk4zyE7rhjAtutvULd+69CbTlLC2VSX6gK\nSL4PIYrMix4B4K8CqoP8V4+U+uCewQoRh/bW0Abgk6be6SNAdVKCXfjmmyZyTkkj\nN0bgqzqNN