inting\n\n* deprecated test setup\n\n* es2022 to use bundler for moduleResolution\n\n* test class\n\n* new keycloak options type\n\n* routerTestingModule deprecation\n\n* tests pass\n\n* init new keycloak\n\n* migrate to using new keycloak\n\n* use env vars\n\n* fix tests from keycloak deprecation\n\n* sonarcloud comments\n\n* edit regex to not match empty string\n\n* compiler changed for tests\n\n* include\n\n* edit path\n\n* add bundler in spite of extending base\n\n* add Bundler to compilerOptions\n\n* remove dupl\n\n* add types to package.json\n\n* add lib to tests tsconfig\n\n* types\n\n* remove types def\n\n* downgrade minor version of keycloakjs\n\n* downgradex2\n\n* test\n\n* downgradex3\n\n* x4\n\n* downgrade to keycloak-js 25\n\n* move null checking\n\n* rename\n\n* test session expiry\n\n* session expiry 5 min\n\n* re-format\n\n* roles parsed from token\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Rajesh Shrestha <yesjesh@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Roya Shourouni <roya.shourouni@gov.bc.ca>\nCo-authored-by: James Hollinger <jameshollinger.ee@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"8e9ae18eeb49bac51e00ca9c687a1fbb75abe53f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/git/trees/8e9ae18eeb49bac51e00ca9c687a1fbb75abe53f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcgov/moh-pidp/git/commits/0585d96664d10d6d003fd73250d8cd38dde47c88","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e9ae18eeb49bac51e00ca9c687a1fbb75abe53f\nparent 0a5c219b7d5bf48aca8ab9f5044d88d9c94b5170\nauthor Panos Hatzinikolaou <45132887+Paahn@users.noreply.github.com> 1774896993 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1774896993 -0700\n\nOHID-330 Angular 19 (#689)\n\n* correct type after deprecation\n\n* Revert \"correct type after deprecation\"\n\nThis reverts commit 26f6c0316d2d144c4faa68974762b19dc8f0dc13.\n\n* angular 19\n\n* correct type after deprecation\n\n* all components, services, directives, pipes are standalone by default\n\n* replace deprecated APP_INITIALIZER\n\n* turn off prefer standalone linting as its now defau